BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DataLab Speaker Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T113000
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52649350360565
DESCRIPTION:Join us for DataLab’s new speaker series this quarter! The s
 eries focuses on how researchers use data science methods and technologies
  in practice. It will include a mix of presentations about active and comp
 leted research projects\, industry projects\, new methods and technologies
  of interest to the community\, and more. The series is organized by DataL
 ab staff and graduate student affiliates.\n\n \n\n10:30-11:30 every Tuesda
 y in DataLab (Shields Library room 360). We will also stream on Zoom\, but
  for the best engagement we recomment attending in person if possible. Adv
 ance registration is required to receive the Zoom link.\n\nAll members of 
 the UC Davis community (students\, staff\, and faculty) are welcome to att
 end. Questions? Interested in presenting or becoming an affiliate? Contact
  datalab@ucdavis.edu.\n\n \n\nWe look forward to seeing you!
LOCATION:Shields Library\, 360
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/datalab-speaker-series-spring
 26
X-SOURCE:UC Davis Library
END:VEVENT
